Viktor: Brunor dialogue puzzle to get him to reveal where Marmiadoise is, have it be lost in the backrooms of the third floor.
brunor: Marmiadoise? Yes, I used it to cleave off the limbs of that traitor, Lancelot. What about it?
Where is it now?
brunor: Blast if I know! That thing's too powerful for its own good, so I threw it away.
Where did you see it last?
brunor: To be honest, I can't quite remember, aside from being hopelessly lost and figuring tossing it out when I had such a feeling would prevent others from finding it.